uting) during training step I'm getting following error on some workers\r\nworker X:\r\n```bash\r\n2024-01-11 05:43:11.726254: E external/xla/xla/service/gpu/nccl_utils.cc:211] Aborting communicator: 0x7f3e427e55b0 due to async NCCL error: remote process exited or there was a network error\r\n2024-01-11 05:43:11.726330: E external/xla/xla/service/gpu/nccl_utils.cc:219] INTERNAL: external/xla/xla/service/gpu/nccl_utils.cc:216: NCCL operation async_err failed: remote process exited or there was a network error\r\n```\r\nworker Y:\r\n```bash\r\n2024-01-11 05:42:58.876471: E external/xla/xla/service/gpu/nccl_utils.cc:211] Aborting communicator: 0x7f45267e31a0 due to async NCCL error: remote process exited or there was a network error\r\n2024-01-11 05:42:58.876681: E external/xla/xla/service/gpu/nccl_utils.cc:219] INTERNAL: external/xla/xla/service/gpu/nccl_utils.cc:216: NCCL operation async_err failed: remote process exited or there was a network error\r\n```\r\nafter which training hangs forever (or least for 6h+, i've never waited more).\r\nI don't think that it is jax bug, most likely just random fail with hardware as i have lots of GPUs.\r\nThe problem is that I have checkpointing and automatic restoration mechanism is case of fail of any worker but it doesn't work in this case as after this error training process completely hangs instead of failing. \r\n\r\n\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\njax, jaxlib 0.4.20\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nGPU\n\n### Additional system info?\n\nlinux\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n32x8 H100 GPUs, infiniband network, RDMA","closed_at":"2024-10-04T09:44:01Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48059208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qGentry/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qGentry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qGentry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qGentry/gists{/gist_id